        text: "I worked with Oleksii at datuum.ai. He was involved in product design and marketing and did a great job in both directions. Oleksii proved to be dependable and always supported our product and company. He also introduced a new version of the system UI/UX that greatly improved the user experience, which was important because the system was quite complex. I would recommend Oleksii as a great person to deal with, whose creativity and dedication make a great combination of skills in a person you would work with for years.",
    },
    {
        name: "Oleksandr Popov",
        role: "Front-end Developer",
        company: "",
        image: "/oleksandr-testimonial.png",
        text: "I worked with Oleksii at datuum.ai. He was the one who figured out how to implement a technically complex product interface while maintaining a simple and accessible user experience. His work attracted the attention of clients from all over the world. Working in a team, I appreciated the creativity, speed, and quality of work that Oleksii did throughout the project. It's also worth mentioning that Oleksii is a friendly, reliable, easy-going person who will always support and give good advice at the right time.",
    },
    {
        name: "Stanislav Zaborkin",
        role: "Front-end Developer",
        company: "assetbird",
        image: "/stanislav-testimonial.png",
        text: "Oleksii is an exceptional UI/UX designer, consistently delivering high-quality, visually appealing, and user-friendly designs. Oleksii excels in transforming complex requirements into intuitive interfaces, as demonstrated during our work together, which significantly improved user engagement. He is an outstanding team player, always open to feedback and to discuss any task, even the most difficult and challenging. His positive attitude and proactive approach make him a valuable asset.",
    },
    {
        name: "Liuka Lobarieva",
        role: "COO, Co-Founder",
        company: "Calibrated",
        image: "/liuka-testimonial.png",
        text: "During the last four years, I had the pleasure of working with Oleksii on PR, marketing, and brand tasks at Datuum.ai and Calibrated agency. Oleksii's design approach is based on experience, constant exploration of new trends, and a keen sense of catchy design. I loved brainstorming with Oleksii; his ideas and work were always above expectations. His communication style is always friendly and open, making the work process comfortable and easygoing.",
    },
    {
        name: "Nataliya Nakonechna",
        role: "Founder",
        company: "VN Strategies",
        image: "/nataliya-testimonial.jpg",
        text: "Oleksii did a great job! The visual identity that he created for EDIF is impressive, it talks and shows what has to be shown. It's a pleasure to work with him and we will be happy to continue our cooperation🤝",
    },
];

// Color alterations for roles
const accentColors = [
    "text-blue-light",
    "text-yellow-light",
    "text-green-light",
    "text-red-light",
];

// Duplicate testimonials for seamless loop
const duplicatedTestimonials = [
    ...testimonials,
    ...testimonials,
    ...testimonials,
];
---

<section
    id="testimonials"
    class="min-h-fit w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-10"
>
    <div
        class="w-full max-w-7xl flex flex-col pt-12 sm:pt-24 pb-6 gap-8 border-x border-stroke-weak-dark"
    >
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium">
            Kind Words
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="flex border-y border-stroke-weak-dark w-full justify-center">
        <!-- Testimonial Carousel -->
        <div
            id="testimonial-container"
            class="testimonial-carousel-container testimonial-mobile-scroll border-x border-stroke-weak-dark max-w-7xl overflow-hidden"
        >
            <div id="testimonial-track" class="testimonial-carousel-track flex">
                {
                    duplicatedTestimonials.map((testimonial, index) => (
                        <div class="testimonial-card flex flex-col w-full sm:w-lg p-8 sm:p-12 items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6 border-l border-stroke-weak-dark  bg-bg-plaque shrink-0">
                            {/* Avatar and Info */}
                            <div class="flex gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full items-center">
                                <img
                                    src={testimonial.image}
                                    alt={testimonial.name}
                                    class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 object-cover rounded-lg overflow-hidden shrink-0"
                                />

                                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                                    <p class="text-text-primary text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium">
                                        {testimonial.name}
                                    </p>
                                    <p
                                        class={`${accentColors[index % accentColors.length]} mono text-sm sm:text-base text-balance`}
                                    >
                                        {testimonial.role}
                                        {testimonial.company
                                            ? ` @ ${testimonial.company}`
                                            : ""}
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            {/* Testimonial Text */}
                            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-7 sm:leading-8 text-balance">
                                {testimonial.text}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    const container = document.getElementById("testimonial-container");
    const track = document.getElementById("testimonial-track");

    if (!container || !track) {
        console.error("Testimonial elements not found");
    } else {
        const isMobile = window.innerWidth < 768;
        let isAutoScrolling = true;
        let animationId: number;
        let inactivityTimeout: number;
        const INACTIVITY_DELAY = 10000;

        const getCardWidth = () => {
            const card = track.querySelector(
                ".testimonial-card",
            ) as HTMLElement;
            if (!card) return 536;
            return card.offsetWidth + 24;
        };

        const getResetPoint = () => getCardWidth() * 5;

        const resetInactivityTimer = () => {
            clearTimeout(inactivityTimeout);
            inactivityTimeout = window.setTimeout(() => {
                isAutoScrolling = true;
            }, INACTIVITY_DELAY);
        };

        // ========== MOBILE VERSION ==========
        if (isMobile) {
            let lastScrollPos = 0;
            let userScrolling = false;

            const animateMobile = () => {
                if (isAutoScrolling && !userScrolling) {
                    // Increment scroll position
                    container.scrollLeft += 1;

                    // Reset for seamless loop
                    const resetPoint = getResetPoint();
                    if (container.scrollLeft >= resetPoint) {
                        container.scrollLeft =
                            container.scrollLeft - resetPoint;
                        lastScrollPos = container.scrollLeft;
                    }
                }

                animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animateMobile);
            };

            // Detect user swipe
            let scrollTimer: number;
            container.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
                const delta = Math.abs(container.scrollLeft - lastScrollPos);

                // If scroll moved more than auto-scroll would move, user is swiping
                if (delta > 2) {
                    userScrolling = true;
                    isAutoScrolling = false;
                    clearTimeout(inactivityTimeout);
                }

                lastScrollPos = container.scrollLeft;

                // Reset user scrolling flag after they stop
                clearTimeout(scrollTimer);
                scrollTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
                    userScrolling = false;
                    resetInactivityTimer();
                }, 150);
            });

            animateMobile();
        }
        // ========== DESKTOP VERSION ==========
        else {
            let position = 0;
            let isDragging = false;
            let startX = 0;
            let velocity = 0;
            let lastPosition = 0;
            let lastTime = Date.now();

            const animateDesktop = () => {
                if (!isDragging) {
                    if (isAutoScrolling) {
                        position += 0.3;
                    } else {
                        velocity *= 0.95;
                        position += velocity;
                        if (Math.abs(velocity) < 0.1) velocity = 0;
                    }
                }

                const resetPoint = getResetPoint();
                if (position >= resetPoint) {
                    position -= resetPoint;
                } else if (position < 0) {
                    position += resetPoint;
                }

                track.style.transform = `translateX(-${position}px)`;
                animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animateDesktop);
            };

            const handleStart = (clientX: number) => {
                isDragging = true;
                isAutoScrolling = false;
                startX = clientX;
                velocity = 0;
                lastPosition = position;
                lastTime = Date.now();
                track.style.cursor = "grabbing";
                clearTimeout(inactivityTimeout);
            };

            const handleMove = (clientX: number) => {
                if (!isDragging) return;
                const diff = startX - clientX;
                position = lastPosition + diff;

                const now = Date.now();
                const timeDiff = now - lastTime;
                if (timeDiff > 0) {
                    velocity = ((clientX - startX) / timeDiff) * -10;
                }
                lastTime = now;
                startX = clientX;
                lastPosition = position;
            };

            const handleEnd = () => {
                isDragging = false;
                track.style.cursor = "grab";
                resetInactivityTimer();
            };

            track.addEventListener("mousedown", (e) => {
                e.preventDefault();
                handleStart(e.clientX);
            });

            track.addEventListener("mousemove", (e) => handleMove(e.clientX));
            track.addEventListener("mouseup", handleEnd);
            track.addEventListener("mouseleave", handleEnd);

            track.style.cursor = "grab";
            animateDesktop();
        }

        // Cleanup
        window.addEventListener("beforeunload", () => {
            if (animationId) cancelAnimationFrame(animationId);
            clearTimeout(inactivityTimeout);
        });
    }
</script>

<style>
    /* Mobile: Native scroll */
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .testimonial-mobile-scroll {
            overflow-x: scroll;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
            scroll-behavior: auto;
        }
    }

    /* Desktop: Drag */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .testimonial-carousel-track {
            cursor: grab;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .testimonial-carousel-track:active {
            cursor: grabbing;
        }
    }
</style>
